# Tragedy in von Hellmann Forest (Q022), played by a level 63 character who completed Hidden
# Truth (Q021): Tifaren starts it and asks for the cross of Einhasad, which Innocentin gives;
# Tifaren takes it (cond 4); an undead's skull drops (cond 5); Tifaren calls the ghost of the
# priest far away (cond 7; while it stands she says so), whose talk sends it away three seconds
# later (cond 8); Innocentin's letter (cond 9) goes to the ghost of the adventurer for the green
# jewel (cond 10); the well wakes its soul far away, one at a time; any soul of the well killed
# frees the well. Expectations come from the reference trace
# (Q022_TragedyInVonHellmannForest.java, Quest.addSpawn, Quest.dropItems, QuestState.setCond).
